e('pick_jerky').decision='Grass-fed beef jerky with nitrite sources named, including celery powder.';
e('deli_meat_uncured').kristy_take='Whole roasted meat leaves out added curing agents. At the deli counter, the full ingredient list shows celery curing agents and added binders.';
